%% HTTP prefix: /api/v1. API lane includes verified middleware and errorHandler.
%% Grouped read and validation calls short-circuit on error. No Repository layer is implied.
%% No always-Cloudinary claim. Actual driver depends on configuration. File storage is not a SQL transaction.
sequenceDiagram
    actor A as User
    participant UI as ProfilePage / Profile
    participant API as Express middleware / errorHandler
    participant C as authController
    participant S as authService
    participant DB as Mongo models / Prisma
    participant Store as avatarStorage
    A->>UI: Upload avatar image
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/me/avatar
    activate API
    API->>API: authenticate and avatarUpload
    alt authentication or upload rejected
        API-->>UI: Authentication or upload error
    else request accepted
        API->>C: uploadAvatar(req, res, next)
        activate C
        alt multipart avatar missing
            C-->>API: 400 avatar required
        else file present
            C->>Store: storeAvatarImage(file, ownerId, publicBaseUrl)
            activate Store
            Store-->>C: Stored URL or storage exception
            deactivate Store
            C->>S: updateAvatar(userId, avatarUrl) if storage succeeded
            activate S
            S->>DB: User.findById with old avatarUrl
            DB-->>S: User or null
            alt user missing or storage / persistence fails
                S-->>C: 404 or propagated exception
            else user exists and writes succeed
                S->>DB: User.updateOne(avatarUrl) and synchronizeUserProjection
                DB-->>S: Updated identity projection
                S->>Store: Best-effort removeStoredAvatar for replaced old URL
                S-->>C: getMe(userId) profile
            end
            deactivate S
            C-->>API: Updated profile or next(error)
        end
        deactivate C
        API-->>UI: 200 avatar result or mapped error
    end
    deactivate API
    UI-->>A: Show updated avatar or upload failure
%% Storage errors short-circuit before updateAvatar. Driver may be local disk or Cloudinary.
%% Storage is not a database validation operation or part of a distributed transaction.
